    <string name="accessibility_service_label">RoadHouse Overlay Groq</string>
    <string name="accessibility_service_description">Reads the text of the delivery app on screen so RoadHouse Overlay Groq can check offers, find addresses, and answer your questions by voice. It only reads — it never taps or types in any app.</string>

    <string name="main_intro">Voice-first driver assistant. It reads your delivery app screen, checks the offer in dollars per mile, and talks back — hands-free.</string>
    <string name="main_steps_title">First-run setup</string>
    <string name="main_steps">1. Allow the overlay permission.\n2. Turn on RoadHouse Overlay Groq in Accessibility settings (screen reading).\n3. Allow the microphone.\n4. Paste your Groq key and set your $/mile floor in Settings.\n5. Tap Start overlay, then switch to Spark, DoorDash, or Instacart.</string>

